59	     * <p>A list of any size can be returned so there can be multiple models per adapter position.
60	     *
61	     * <p>Every model returned by this method is expected to produce a valid {@link RequestBuilder}
62	     * in {@link #getPreloadRequestBuilder(Object)}. If that's not possible for any set of models,
63	     * avoid including them in the {@link List} returned by this method.
64	     *
